title: "MonsoonCast: A Research-Grade AI Ensemble Framework for Extreme Monsoon Rainfall Prediction and Uncertainty Quantification over India"
abstract: "A reproducible, physics-aware machine learning ensemble framework designed for extreme monsoon precipitation forecasting, probabilistic calibration, and rigorous uncertainty quantification over India."
